  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2016-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "For any nonzero \\(a,b,\\) we have \\[\\dfrac{a\\heartsuit b}{b\\heartsuit a} = \\dfrac{a^3b^2}{b^3 a^2} = \\dfrac ab .\\] Using \\(a=2,b=4,\\) we get that \\(\\frac{ 2}{4} = \\frac 12.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is B .",
      "hints": [
        "Compute the operation ratio symbolically first",
        "\\(\\frac{n\\heartsuit m}{m\\heartsuit n}=\\frac nm\\)"
      ],
